# packages - the frr_demo part of the Demo picker of the frr toy, appended to
# demos/packages by create_frr_toy_targz.sh. Same format: "<number> <title>",
# then "<area>/<demo>.py  <one line>". The line is the section title of the
# FRR User Guide the demo plays.

